<SiteLayout path="about" title="Meet Dave | LEDJS Wedding & Event DJs, Longford" description="Meet Dave and the music-led approach behind LEDJS. Wedding, party and corporate DJs based in Longford, with Songo Music Bingo and optional LED wristbands.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap page-hero-grid"><div><h1>Your music.<br />Your people.<br />Meet Dave.</h1><p>Good entertainment starts with understanding the people in the room. Let's talk about the night you want to create.</p><a class="button" href="/contact">Tell Dave your plans</a></div><Picture name="ledjs2" alt="Dave hosting an event" priority /></div></section>
  <article class="page-copy"><h2>Music first. Your event at the centre.</h2><p>LEDJS is based in Longford, providing wedding, party and corporate DJ entertainment. For weddings, choose a full evening with a DJ or an after-band set, with planning shaped around the music you love.</p><p>Share your ideas, the songs that matter and anything you'd rather leave out. The aim is to create a night that feels right for you and your guests, with the practical details discussed before the event.</p><h2>More ways to bring people together.</h2><p>LEDJS is a Songo Music Bingo franchisee, and also offers speed quizzing, karaoke and synchronised LED wristbands. These experiences can stand on their own or be discussed as part of your event.</p><h2>Start with a conversation.</h2><p>Your date, venue and a little about your crowd are a useful starting point. We'll discuss availability, setup, timings and a tailored quote.</p><div class="page-actions"><a class="button" href="/contact">Start your enquiry</a><a class="text-link" href="/services">Explore the services</a></div></article>
</SiteLayout>
